</style></div><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="page-top" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-e359d2da-de19-6775-b122-3e06f925f39e u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="hero_main_contain u-container"><div class="hero_main_layout u-grid-custom"><div class="hero_main_title"><div data-fade-in="false" data-split-heading="false" data-number="16" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h1" class="u-text w-variant-792802b6-ccdb-f982-5023-5fa970cf03d0 w-richtext u-heading-accent u-margin-bottom-0"><h1><strong>At</strong> home, <br/><strong>with </strong>us.</h1></div></div><div class="hero_main_content u-align-self-end"><div data-fade-in="false" data-split-heading="false" data-number="40" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h5" class="u-text w-variant-326a9562-3263-06da-e8ef-16981fd70f1c w-richtext u-color-accent"><h3><strong>Authentic Hospitality</strong></h3></div><div data-fade-in="false" data-number="33" data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="text-main" class="u-text w-variant-61d538b2-709c-eb7a-4258-8c0890dc07fc w-richtext u-rich-text u-margin-bottom-0"><p>Five personalities, <br/>ein gelebter Familienbetrieb.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="small" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-d422cbd0-f212-c815-68df-63414354c21d u-ignore-trim"></div><div data-hero-main-visual-wrap="" class="hero_main_visual"><div class="hero_main_visual_img u-cover-absolute"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-hero-main-visual=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69009d4a64fee1661fbbca09_Placeholder-2.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Four smiling restaurant staff wearing white shirts and aprons standing outside a building." class="u-image"/></div></div><div class="hero_main_visual_vid u-cover-absolute"><video data-wf--visual-video--variant="cover" src="https://jordang.b-cdn.net/J%C3%A4gerhof/jagerhod_hero_placeholder.mp4" autoplay=" " loop="" muted="" playsinline=" " class="u-video w-variant-db26956a-7929-76af-05b0-02971cbab2f4" STYLE="" poster=""></video></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="none" class="u-section-spacer u-ignore-trim"></div></section><section id="" class="legal_wrap u-section"><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
