</style></div><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="page-top" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-e359d2da-de19-6775-b122-3e06f925f39e u-ignore-trim"></div><div class="legal_contain u-container"><div class="legal_layout u-grid-custom"><div class="legal_content"><div data-fade-in="false" data-split-heading="false" data-number="20" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h1" class="u-text w-variant-792802b6-ccdb-f982-5023-5fa970cf03d0 w-richtext u-heading-accent u-margin-bottom-0"><h1>Family Augscheller</h1></div><div class="legal_text u-rich-text_article u-margin-trim w-richtext"><h2>Welcome to the Jägerhof – <br/>Your family-run hotel in South Tyrol</h2><p>‍</p><p>We warmly welcome you to the Jägerhof, a hotel where the whole family works together to make your stay in South Tyrol unforgettable. Our house was built in 1965 by Grandpa Hans and Grandma Maria and has always stood for family hospitality and warmth. Today, we — Siegi and Irmgard — run the family hotel in Walten in the Passeier Valley together with our children Matthias and Magdalena, delighting our guests with heartfelt service, a family atmosphere, and personal care.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-wf--spacer--section-space="main" class="u-section-spacer w-variant-60a7ad7d-02b0-6682-95a5-2218e6fd1490 u-ignore-trim"></div></section><section data-wf--section-layout-2-col--section-variant="image-left" id="" class="layout_2-col_wrap u-section"><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
