</style></div><div class="layout_2-col_layout u-grid-breakout"><div class="layout_2-col_content w-variant-436088c1-fa15-662d-e023-d421af4494a7"><div class="layout_2-col_title_wrap"><div data-fade-in="true" data-split-heading="false" data-number="40" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h5" class="u-text w-variant-326a9562-3263-06da-e8ef-16981fd70f1c w-richtext u-margin-bottom-6 u-color-accent"><li><strong>Introducing the Augscheller Family</strong></li></div><div data-number="14" data-split-heading="true" class="layout_2-col_title u-text-style-h1">Siegi</div></div><div data-fade-in="true" class="layout_2-col_text_wrap"><div data-fade-in="false" data-number="50" data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="u-text w-richtext u-rich-text"><p>About 25 years ago, Siegi, together with his wife Irmgard, took over the family business. Since then, he has been running the Jägerhof in Walten at the Jaufen Pass with exactly what defines him: <strong>dedication, vision, and true passion.</strong> He knows the house better than anyone else and is familiar with every corner and detail. And honestly: without him, nothing here would probably run smoothly.</p><p>He gives his all to live and share our values: <strong>genuine hospitality, true family togetherness, and sustainable, regionally rooted tourism</strong> that touches people.</p><p><strong>My motto: <br/></strong>&quot;Carry on with gratitude, create with passion.&quot;</p><p><strong>What I enjoy doing: <br/></strong>baking bread</p><p><strong>My favorite spot in the Passeier Valley: <br/></strong>our sunny terrace</p><p><strong>You can usually find me at the Jägerhof: <br/></strong>in the kitchen and at the reception</p></div></div></div><div class="layout_2-col_visual w-variant-436088c1-fa15-662d-e023-d421af4494a7"><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-position="right" data-number="30" class="layout_2-col_visual_foreground u-ratio-4-5"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6913310f06bab2fcbcd1a500_DSCF9342.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Person hält ein hölzernes Blech mit vier frisch gebackenen Broten." class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6913310f06bab2fcbcd1a500_DSCF9342.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Person hält ein hölzernes Blech mit vier frisch gebackenen Broten." class="u-image"/></div></div><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-parallax="trigger" data-parallax-scrub="2" data-parallax-start="-30" data-parallax-end="0" class="layout_2-col_background"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69132f3ee4bf7ae23641112a_DSCF8653.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Älterer Mann mit weißen Haaren trägt eine weiße Poloshirt und schwarze Schürze, steht lächelnd mit Hand auf der Hüfte vor einem bewaldeten Berg." sizes="(max-width: 3384px) 100vw, 3384px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69132f3ee4bf7ae23641112a_DSCF8653-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69132f3ee4bf7ae23641112a_DSCF8653.avif 640w" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69132f3ee4bf7ae23641112a_DSCF8653.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Älterer Mann mit weißen Haaren trägt eine weiße Poloshirt und schwarze Schürze, steht lächelnd mit Hand auf der Hüfte