</style></div><div class="layout_2-col_layout u-grid-breakout"><div class="layout_2-col_content"><div class="layout_2-col_title_wrap"><div data-fade-in="true" data-split-heading="false" data-number="40" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h5" class="u-text w-variant-326a9562-3263-06da-e8ef-16981fd70f1c w-richtext u-margin-bottom-6 u-color-accent"><li><strong>Introducing the Augscheller Family</strong></li></div><div data-number="14" data-split-heading="true" class="layout_2-col_title u-text-style-h1">Irmgard</div></div><div data-fade-in="true" class="layout_2-col_text_wrap"><div data-fade-in="false" data-number="45" data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="u-text w-richtext u-rich-text"><p>Irmgard’s professional journey originally began in the <strong>kindergarden</strong>; perhaps this explains her <strong>warm and loving nature</strong>, which she brings to her interactions with people to this day. When she met Siegi, she moved to Walten, and for over <strong>30 years</strong> she has been ensuring that our guests feel completely at home at the Jägerhof. </p><p>Like Siegi, Irmgard shares the <strong>same values</strong>: genuine hospitality, a deep connection to the region, and above all a strong belief that <strong>family cohesion</strong> is the most important foundation for a family-run business like the Jägerhof.<br/>‍</p><p><strong>My motto:</strong><br/>&quot;Home is where you feel welcome.&quot;</p><p><strong>What I enjoy doing:</strong><br/>Exploring the world</p><p><strong>My favorite spot in the Passeier Valley:</strong><br/>At Schneeberg</p><p><strong>You can usually find me at the Jägerhof:</strong><br/>Everywhere</p></div></div></div><div class="layout_2-col_visual"><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-position="right" data-number="30" class="layout_2-col_visual_foreground u-ratio-4-5"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6913337a23245ef1fe40a7c9_DSCF8673.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Person fügt ein Stück Holz in einen Kamin mit brennendem Feuer ein." class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6913337a23245ef1fe40a7c9_DSCF8673.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Person fügt ein Stück Holz in einen Kamin mit brennendem Feuer ein." class="u-image"/></div></div><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-parallax="trigger" data-parallax-scrub="2" data-parallax-start="-30" data-parallax-end="0" class="layout_2-col_background"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133446139c8b6035569c7f_DSCF9196.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Ältere Frau mit grauen Haaren gießend Kaffee aus einer Metallkanne in eine graue Tasse in einem Café." sizes="(max-width: 3384px) 100vw, 3384px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133446139c8b6035569c7f_DSCF9196-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133446139c8b6035569c7f_DSCF9196.avif 640w" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133446139c8b6035569c7f_DSCF9196.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Ältere Frau mit grauen Haaren gießend Kaffee aus einer Metallkanne in eine graue Tasse in einem Café." sizes="(max-width: 3384px) 100vw, 3384px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133446139c8b6035