</style></div><div class="layout_2-col_layout u-grid-breakout"><div class="layout_2-col_content w-variant-436088c1-fa15-662d-e023-d421af4494a7"><div class="layout_2-col_title_wrap"><div data-fade-in="true" data-split-heading="false" data-number="40" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h5" class="u-text w-variant-326a9562-3263-06da-e8ef-16981fd70f1c w-richtext u-margin-bottom-6 u-color-accent"><li><strong>Introducing the Augscheller Family</strong></li></div><div data-number="14" data-split-heading="true" class="layout_2-col_title u-text-style-h1">Matthias</div></div><div data-fade-in="true" class="layout_2-col_text_wrap"><div data-fade-in="false" data-number="44" data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="u-text w-richtext u-rich-text"><p>Matthias is our <strong>culinary creative mind</strong>; a junior chef who brings fresh energy to the Jägerhof and elevates <strong>vegetarian cuisine in Walten</strong> with his ideas. After graduating from the Kaiserhof Hotel Management School in Merano, he joined the family business directly. For the past eight years, he has been working alongside his father in the kitchen, giving the Jägerhof cuisine its modern and distinctive signature.</p><p>He is especially known for his <strong>creative vegetarian dishes,</strong> which even convince dedicated meat lovers and leave them amazed. His cooking is fresh, bold, and guided by a clear philosophy: <strong>regional, seasonal, and full of passion.</strong></p><p><strong>My motto:</strong><br/>&quot;Inspiration can be found everywhere; you just have to be open to it.&quot;</p><p><strong>What I enjoy doing:</strong><br/>Travelling</p><p><strong>My favorite spot in the Passeier Valley:</strong><br/>In the kitchen</p><p><strong>You can usually find me at the Jägerhof:</strong><br/>Behind the stove</p></div></div></div><div class="layout_2-col_visual w-variant-436088c1-fa15-662d-e023-d421af4494a7"><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-position="right" data-number="30" class="layout_2-col_visual_foreground u-ratio-4-5"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/691335bac486c110e9616a2a_DSCF9168.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Hand erntet frische Kräuter in einem Garten mit einem Holzschüssel voller Blätter." class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/691335bac486c110e9616a2a_DSCF9168.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Hand erntet frische Kräuter in einem Garten mit einem Holzschüssel voller Blätter." class="u-image"/></div></div><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-parallax="trigger" data-parallax-scrub="2" data-parallax-start="-30" data-parallax-end="0" class="layout_2-col_background"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133555c1a5785c4fbcb1e9_DSCF9184.avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Porträt eines Mannes mit Brille, der eine schwarze Schürze trägt und eine braune Schüssel hält, mit bewaldeten Bergen im Hintergrund." sizes="(max-width: 3384px) 100vw, 3384px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133555c1a5785c4fbcb1e9_DSCF9184-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133555c1a5785c4fbcb1e9_DSCF9184.avif 640w" class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/69133555c1a5785c4fbcb1e9_DSCF9184.avif" loading