</style></div><div class="layout_2-col_layout u-grid-breakout"><div class="layout_2-col_content w-variant-436088c1-fa15-662d-e023-d421af4494a7"><div class="layout_2-col_title_wrap"><div data-fade-in="true" data-split-heading="false" data-number="40" data-wf--typography-heading--font-style="h5" class="u-text w-variant-326a9562-3263-06da-e8ef-16981fd70f1c w-richtext u-margin-bottom-6 u-color-accent"><li><strong>Introducing the Augscheller Family</strong></li></div><div data-number="14" data-split-heading="true" class="layout_2-col_title u-text-style-h1">Emilia</div></div><div data-fade-in="true" class="layout_2-col_text_wrap"><div data-fade-in="false" data-number="30" data-wf--typography-paragraph--font-style="inherit" class="u-text w-richtext u-rich-text"><p>Emilia is the youngest member of our Jägerhof family, at least at heart.<br/>As our <strong>god-calf</strong>, she lives on the <strong>Aignerhof</strong>, a loving organic farm in St. Martin, where she <strong>grows up with her mother </strong>and experiences the first steps of her life in a natural and safe environment. Still small, curious, and a little clumsy, she explores her world there, always surrounded by attentive care, fresh mountain air, her mother Ella, and a mixed-age herd.</p><p>For us at the Jägerhof, Emilia is more than just a god-calf; she represents <strong>respect for animals, a connection to the region, and appreciation for genuine farm work.</strong> We are delighted to accompany her a little on her journey of growing up and to be part of her small yet significant story.</p><p><strong>My motto:</strong><br/>&quot;Small, curious, right in the middle.&quot;</p><p><strong>What I enjoy doing:</strong><br/>Chasing chickens ;) and using the barn as an adventure playground</p><p><strong>My favorite spot in St. Leonhard:</strong><br/>Very close to my mom.</p><p><strong>Where you can find me at the Jägerhof:</strong><br/>In many stories and in our hearts. 🐄💚</p></div></div></div><div class="layout_2-col_visual w-variant-436088c1-fa15-662d-e023-d421af4494a7"><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-position="right" data-number="30" class="layout_2-col_visual_foreground u-ratio-4-5"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6921dc6a458d699044d57399_9aa20770-f583-4b63-aad8-5f0c677dbcbc%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Eine braune Kuh mit weißen Flecken und ein Kalb stehen in einem Stall neben einer rot-blauen Bürste, im Hintergrund sind Berge zu sehen." class="u-image"/></div><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-winter=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6921dc6a458d699044d57399_9aa20770-f583-4b63-aad8-5f0c677dbcbc%20(1).avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Eine braune Kuh mit weißen Flecken und ein Kalb stehen in einem Stall neben einer rot-blauen Bürste, im Hintergrund sind Berge zu sehen." class="u-image"/></div></div><div data-theme-image-wrap="" data-parallax="trigger" data-parallax-scrub="2" data-parallax-start="-30" data-parallax-end="0" class="layout_2-col_background"><div data-wf--visual-image--variant="cover" class="u-image-wrapper w-variant-4972adff-107c-1f37-d19c-526a2bf55c28" STYLE="" data-theme-image-summer=""><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6921e39b16d0518df6c368ce_f54646cf-ac52-4711-b229-21b834e4497c%20(2).avif" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="Kalb liegt auf Stroh in einem Stall mit metallischen Gitterstäben im Hintergrund." sizes="(max-width: 3384px) 100vw, 3384px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6921e39b16d0518df6c368ce_f54646cf-ac52-4711-b229-21b834e4497c%20(2)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f600e7f8352629c0b73507/6921e39b16d05