ures an authentic and high-quality, artisanal cuisine. While Siegi preserves the traditional South Tyrolean roots, Matthias brings modern influences and creative, especially vegetarian dishes, contributing to a contemporary culinary experience.</p></div></div></div><div data-theme-slide="summer" role="listitem" class="slider_item w-dyn-item"><div class="slide_wrap"><div class="slide_visual"><div data-slide-button="" class="slide_button_wrap"><div data-wf--button-main--variant="primary" class="button_main_wrap" data-button=" " data-trigger="hover focus"><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
